        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-14",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This Statement of Work (SOW) outlines the collaboration between Acme Corp and Faires A. Sekiya to create a modern, visually engaging portfolio website for an experienced cinematographer. The project will involve an initial discovery phase to gather creative assets and establish strategic direction, followed by a 5–7 week design and development phase aimed at delivering a polished, user-friendly web presence. Post-launch, we will provide optional social media management and ongoing support to enhance visibility, drive engagement, and bolster search engine rankings. By combining high-quality visuals, industry-specific SEO best practices, and a user-centric design, this engagement aims to highlight the client's extensive experience and unique skill set in the competitive film industry."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-15",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Primary Contact Information**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-17",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-16",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Contractor (Sample User)**:"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-18",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
