    },
    {
      "id": "b-138",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-139",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**SEO & Analytics Overview**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-140",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**1. Why SEO Matters for a Cinematographer's Site**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-142",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-141",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Visibility & Credibility**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-143",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "When potential collaborators or producers Google your name or relevant terms (e.g., \"Chicago steadicam operator,\" \"veteran camera operator\"), strong search rankings help them find you—reinforcing your professional reputation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-145",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-144",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Targeted Keywords**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-146",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Focusing on specific industry phrases (e.g., \"cinematographer with 20+ years' experience,\" \"feature film camera operator\") ensures you reach the right audience. This is especially beneficial given your wide range of skills and impressive credits."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-148",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-147",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Backlinks & Referrals**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-149",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Linking to and from platforms like IMDb, press mentions, and festival pages will boost your domain authority. Consistent cross-referencing helps search engines see you as a credible figure in the field."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-150",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**2. On-Page SEO Essentials**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-152",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-151",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Meta Tags & Descriptions**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-153",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Framer lets you customize page titles, meta descriptions, and Open Graph data—ensuring that search engines and social media platforms display concise, keyword-rich summaries of each page."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-155",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-154",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Structured Content**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-156",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Highlight your filmography, awards, and skill sets on dedicated pages so search engines can easily parse the information. We can also incorporate schema markup for creative professionals to further enhance search visibility."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-158",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-157",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Image & Video Optimization**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-159",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Adding alt text to still frames and properly labeling your reels (e.g., \"Cinematography Reel – Faires Anderson\") helps search engines better understand and index visual media."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-160",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**3. Leveraging Framer's SEO Tools**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-162",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-161",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Custom Domains & SSL**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-163",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Connecting your domain (faires.film) in Framer ensures a secure, professional URL—vital for SEO trust signals."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-165",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-164",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Built-In Meta Editing**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-166",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Framer's interface makes it easy to add titles, descriptions, and social share images for each page without needing extra plugins."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-168",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-167",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Performance & Responsive Layouts**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-169",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Fast-loading, mobile-friendly experiences are crucial to SEO. Framer's modern layout engine inherently supports responsive design and optimized loading times."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-170",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**4. Analytics & Ongoing Optimization**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-172",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-171",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Google Analytics / GA4**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-173",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Integrate Google Analytics (or an alternative) directly within Framer to track visits, geographic data, bounce rate, and referral sources—letting us see how people find and interact with your site."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-175",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-174",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**User Behavior Insights**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-176",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Understanding which pages (e.g., your reel or credits) get the most views helps us refine content layout and calls-to-action."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-178",
      "type": "bulletList",
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "b-177",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "**Continuous Tweaks**"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-179",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "As you build new credits and reel updates, we'll adjust meta tags and link structures to stay current with new work and maintain SEO momentum."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-180",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**5. Recommended Next Steps**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-181",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Keyword Brainstorm**: Identify the core phrases you want to rank for (e.g., \"Steadicam operator for TV & Film,\" \"Chicago-based cinematographer,\" etc.)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-182",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Backlink Strategy**: Reach out to film blogs, industry partners, or festival sites to link back to your portfolio."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-183",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Monitor & Refine**: Review analytics monthly or quarterly, then make content updates and link-building efforts as needed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-184",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**In short**, SEO ensures your extensive experience and unique skill set are discoverable by the people who matter—directors, producers, and industry peers. With Framer's built-in SEO features and robust analytics, we'll create a polished, high-performance site that both *looks* and *ranks* the part."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-185",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "---"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-186",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Required Assets & Access**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-187",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Show Reel Assets**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-188",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Short Teaser Reel** for the landing page (fast-paced, ~30 seconds of strongest shots)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-189",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- **Full-Length Reel** to embed or link to after button click."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-190",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- *Note*: If any footage is missing, let me know—we can **scrape MP4s from YouTube** (with your permission) to fill gaps."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-191",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Credits & Accolades**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-192",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- A **comprehensive list** of relevant films, commercials, or other key projects (include any awards, festival laurels, or special recognition)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-193",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- High-res images or posters you want showcased."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-194",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Domain & Hosting**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-195",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Admin or collaborator **access to Namecheap** (for faires.film) so I can connect it to Framer."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-196",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Credentials or info for setting up your **custom email address** (if desired)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-197",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Illustrating Value & Differentiators**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-198",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "1. **Professional Background**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-199",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- A short write-up of your **20+ years** in the industry: major milestones, interesting anecdotes, or marquee projects that highlight experience."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-200",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Any quick blurbs or personal philosophies that show how your approach differs from trend-chasing newcomers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-201",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "2. **Breadth of Skills / Knowledge**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-202",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- A bullet-point list of your technical proficiencies and unique skills: cameras, lighting rigs, specialized setups, or advanced post-workflow knowledge."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-203",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Mention if you do location scouting, creative direction, etc."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-204",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "3. **Process & Approach**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-205",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- A high-level view of how you work on set: from pre-production planning to on-the-fly problem-solving."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-206",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Any key values or principles you follow that underscore professionalism and reliability (e.g., \"Never miss a deadline,\" \"Collaborative spirit with directors,\" etc.)."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-207",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "4. **Positioning Against the 'New Wave'**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-208",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- If you want to emphasize a **lo-fi or old-school aesthetic** that subtly conveys deep expertise, gather references or style inspirations."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-209",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Input on how you see yourself standing out from younger, more experimental peers."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-210",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "- Possible stories about times you used tried-and-true techniques to solve on-set challenges where modern gear failed."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-211",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "**Additional Materials (Optional)**"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-212",
