    },
    {
      "id": "b-293",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Upon signing this document and receiving the initial deposit, we'll begin the Discovery phase on January 13th, 2024 (tentative), with an anticipated launch in mid to late February. This timeline allows for thorough development while maintaining flexibility for play, testing, and creative refinement."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "b-294",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "We appreciate your trust in our team to bring your legacy to life online. We look forward to a creative and productive partnership!"
        }
